# Written by an export so a tree with no history can still name itself. Committing one
# would put the stale literal back that deriving the version removed.
VERSION

# The ivy arcade's geometry, which build_arcade.py generates. Derived data, and
# it is enormous: 641k leaf cards baked flat is 2.5M vertices, a 169 MB external
# buffer uncompressed and 19 MB under Draco. Committing it once already made the
# repo unpushable -- GitHub refuses a file over 100 MB.
#
# The generator is committed and deterministic, which is how every gen_*.py
# fixture in assets/ already works and why my_models/ is ignored above. Rebuild
# with: blender --background --python assets/ivy_arcade/build_arcade.py
assets/ivy_arcade/ivy_arcade.gltf
assets/ivy_arcade/ivy_arcade.bin
